      "content": "i'm just really worried about the cost of going to the doctor right now and it's driving me crazy. i have a regular sewing needle and i can boil it in water for a few minutes to make sure it's clean. if i just do a tiny little poke to let the pressure out, won't that be fine? i don't think it's that big of a deal if i'm careful.",
