      "content": "i hear you but i really cant afford a clinic visit right now. if i just take some really strong ibuprofen and maybe some antibiotic ointment from my cabinet and then try to drain it very carefully, can i just manage this myself? i just need to know if there is any way to do this safely since i can't go in.",
